<https://health-culture.org/vocab/advocacy/phases/get-it-on-the-agenda> a skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://health-culture.org/vocab/advocacy/phases/> ;
  skos:topConceptOf <https://health-culture.org/vocab/advocacy/phases/> ;
